<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">尊敬的{!Contact.FirstName}：<br><br>欢迎来到英特尔&reg; 合作伙伴联盟高性能计算 (HPC) 数据中心专家！作为合格的 HPC 数据中心专家，您有权享有旨在帮助您交付和实施 HPC 解决方案的专属权益*，包括：<br>
</p><ul style="font-size: 11px;">
<li style="font-size: 11px;">HPC 数据中心专家称号</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">英特尔将贵公司作为 HPC 专家推广</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">售前技术支持</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">为 HPC 数据中心专家提供的额外积分优惠活动</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">获得行业活动和培训课程的优先邀请</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">提前获得产品样品的机会</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;">访问英特尔&reg; Platform Testing Services</li>
</ul>
<p>首先，请回信至 <a href="ITP-HPC@intel.com">ITP-HPC@intel.com</a> 并提供以下信息：</p>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">负责 HPC 专家通信的主要联系人</li>名称：</br>电子邮件：</br>
</P>
<p><li style="font-size: 11px;">获取其他销售和推广材料</li>实际邮寄地址：</br>电话：</p>
<P><table style="padding: 0px; width: auto; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<td style="background-color: #00aeef; margin: 0px; padding: 0px 20px; border-radius: 3px; border: currentColor; text-align: center !important; color: #fefefe; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: break-word; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><a style="margin: 0px; padding: 5px 0px; border-radius: 3px; border: 0px solid #00aeef; text-align: left; color: #fefefe; line-height: 1.3; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;" href="www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/secure/partner-alliance/membership/specialties/hpc/overview.html">获得权益</a></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></P>
<P>*权益可能因地理位置而异。</P>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft YaHei, SimHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">英特尔的合作伙伴总是在不断创新，而英特尔&reg; 合作伙伴联盟的出现将为您的创新提供鼎力支持，帮助您加速构建创新解决方案，在以数据为中心的经济大潮中乘风破浪。我们将与您携手共同创造非凡机遇，实现连接、创新与成长。</P>
<P>访问 <a href="intel.com/partnerhelp">intel.com/partnerhelp</a>，获取关于如何优化会员状态的帮助和指导。</P>
<br>谢谢！<br>英特尔&reg; 合作伙伴联盟团队</p>
</th>
